KhHXuxVC8kp86CmQ.jpg","genre_ids":[18],"id":5156,"title":"Złodzieje rowerów","original_language":"it","original_title":"Ladri di biciclette","overview":"Powojenne Włochy. Bezrobotni czekają na ogłoszenia o pracę przed Biurem Zatrudnienia. Ojciec rodziny Antonio dostaje zajęcie, które wymaga poruszania się po mieście rowerem - rozwieszanie ogłoszeń. Razem z żoną Marią wykupuje swój rower z lombardu, gdzie wcześniej go zastawił, aby zdobyć pieniądze na utrzymanie rodziny. W zamian zastawia kilka pamiątek rodzinnych.","popularity":6.3823,"poster_path":"/rQtQwmhqtbuSIoKw6GwglTT8NaY.jpg","release_date":"1948-07-21","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":8.168,"vote_count":2703,"character":"A Seminary Student (uncredited)","credit_id":"57a51520c3a368615a006754","order":13},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[99,10770],"id":721606,"title":"Sergio Leone - C'era una volta il sogno americano","original_language":"it","original_title":"Sergio Leone - C'era una volta il sogno americano","overview":"","popularity":0.6321,"poster_path":"/lKEJ98RrE62bdPwEmmnem5nr01B.jpg","release_date":"2002-01-01","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":0.0,"vote_count":0,"character":"Self (archive footage)","credit_id":"66c5b7ad12d3eace87af5d35","order":0},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/sf9oYeciixD6WGxVkOkxgQMs0jn.jpg","genre_ids":[99],"id":469732,"title":"Il était une fois Sergio Leone","original_language":"fr","original_title":"Il était une fois Sergio Leone","overview":"","popularity":1.358,"poster_path":"/zBgR765Vb4CgeBu7wk6qOuxNiaK.jpg","release_date":"2014-10-19","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":0.0,"vote_count":0,"character":"Self","credit_id":"598735509251413d4201b681","order":0},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[99],"id":506075,"title":"Kino kolossal - Herkules, Maciste & Co","original_language":"de","original_title":"Kino kolossal - Herkules, Maciste & Co","overview":"","popularity":1.1926,"poster_path":"/gGNJ6hgIVO33NknokStZnatgW