Jest rok 280 p.n.e. Grek z kontynentu, Darios, przybywa na wyspę Rodos, by odwiedzić swojego wujka. W tym czasie na wyspie dochodzi do niepokojów. Grupa spiskowców, pod wodzą Pelioklesa, chce obalić króla-tyrana. Darios szybko zostaje wplątany w polityczne intrygi...","popularity":3.1345,"poster_path":"/2XrAhsOCV4bTqx1bW472zkZCHnp.jpg","release_date":"1961-06-15","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.9,"vote_count":214,"credit_id":"52fe4627c3a36847f80efb67","department":"Directing","job":"Director"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/2F1eazYvkmXlzvh42Pd67oxxR0x.jpg","genre_ids":[12],"id":96786,"title":"Romolo e Remo","original_language":"it","original_title":"Romolo e Remo","overview":"","popularity":1.7388,"poster_path":"/mKLZgobb3CzunasJiP2AXZ9tLOW.jpg","release_date":"1961-12-06","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.2,"vote_count":29,"credit_id":"6279542472d85513074d0085","department":"Writing","job":"Story"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/2F1eazYvkmXlzvh42Pd67oxxR0x.jpg","genre_ids":[12],"id":96786,"title":"Romolo e Remo","original_language":"it","original_title":"Romolo e Remo","overview":"","popularity":1.7388,"poster_path":"/mKLZgobb3CzunasJiP2AXZ9tLOW.jpg","release_date":"1961-12-06","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.2,"vote_count":29,"credit_id":"627954719979d234ffdfc4bc","department":"Writing","job":"Screenplay"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/rE0lIGJob9VZTfKby8OolUcAQ3q.jpg","genre_ids":[35,9648,80],"id":183560,"title":"Il gatto","original_language":"it","original_title":"Il gatto","overview":"","popularity":1.174,"poster_path":"/uyImcOU9HqqDbpOZRejWDiaXff9.jpg","release_date":"1977-12-16","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.98,"vote_count":49,"credit_id":"52fe4ca59251416c75120fe9","department":"Production","job":"Producer"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/nk5gq5rNLBJiHvNGMRT6I9VRQX7.jpg","genre_ids":[36,18,12],"id":665,"title":"Ben Hur","original_language":"en","original_title":"Ben-Hur","overview":"Juda Ben Hur jest bogatym żydowskim księciem, kupcem z Jerozolimy. Razem z nowym gubernatorem przyjeżdża jego stary przyjaciel Messala - dowódca legionów rzymskich. Najpierw przyjaciele cieszą się ze spotkania, potem poróżniają ich poglądy polityczne. Podczas powitalnej parady spada dachówka z dachu Judy i tylko cudem nie kaleczy nowego gubernatora. Chociaż Messala wie, że to był tylko wypadek, wysyła Judę na galery, a jego matkę i córkę do więzienia. Ben Hur przyrzeka zemstę.","popularity":14.6264,"poster_path":"/9DdOq7DStzgSXI2F2oars6PB01X.jpg","release_date":"1959-11-18","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.891,"vote_count":3197,"credit_id":"6295c09ceee1860ef032a09b","department":"Directing","job":"Second Unit Director"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/94zNtBxRZaC0JbGizS1Fxs2qxNw.jpg","genre_ids":[35],"id":246279,"title":"Hanno rubato un tram","original_language":"it","original_title":"Hanno rubato un tram","overview":"","popularity":0.8626,"poster_path":"/apnmG5d4IQEEDulNLfWDvcODtt9.jpg","release_date":"1954-12-28","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.2,"vote_count":10,"credit_id":"62d2ccc191745b004cba7f86","department":"Directing","job":"First Assistant Director"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/Ab1RHMGFlmlwgyIJMW7nJ9rJkUB.jpg","genre_ids":[35],"id":58548,"title":"Mi permette babbo!","original_language":"it","original_title":"Mi permette babbo!","overview":"","popularity":0.993,"poster_path":"/fWrTZ9oV2UzjUcipIxQxyOgjGCI.jpg","release_date":"1956-12-06","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.929,"vote_count":14,"credit_id":"62d3f2d12d1e40004ece01a6","department":"Directing","job":"First Assistant Director"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/tXjtTg1TcpqUePNgdFrBg56hMUC.jpg","genre_ids":[37],"id":336,"title":"Garść dynamitu","original_language":"it","original_title":"Giù la testa","overview":"W Meksyku spotykają się irlandzki rewolucjonista, Sean Mallory, specjalista od materiałów wybuchowych oraz awanturnik Juan Miranda. Mężczyźni post